OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC had contact with brothel
OL,4,Aand sex lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Kent Police officer who worked
OL,7,Finvestigating modern slavery and human
OL,8,Ftrafficking would have been dismissed
OL,9,Ffor making contact with brothels and
OL,10,Fadult sex websites, had he not already
OL,11,Fretired, a watchdog has found.
OL,13,FThe Independent Office of Police
OL,14,FConduct (IOPC) found the personal
OL,15,Fmobile number of PC Trevor Bonett had
OL,16,Ftwice made contact with a brothel in
OL,17,Fthe Maidstone area.
OL,19,FPhone data also revealed that he made
OL,20,Fcontact with sex lines or adult sex
OL,21,Fwebsites while on annual leave or rest
OL,22,Fdays between January and June 2024.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
